{"id":101,"chapter_id":0,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"そのぐらいしか覚えてないなんて……本当、残酷な運命……","voice":["vo_cgplot_101001"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"content":"でも、大丈夫……自分が何者なのかを覚えているなら、全てを失うことはない……","voice":["vo_cgplot_101002"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"content":"さぁ、私のところに戻って……あなたの戦いはもう始まってるわ。","voice":["vo_cgplot_101003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"待ってる……から……","voice":["vo_cgplot_101004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}